  "title": "Coast Guard rescues fisherman in Shelikof Strait",
  "description": "A Coast Guard MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew from Air Station Kodiak rescues the five-man crew of the 58-foot fishing vessel Scandia after their vessel began taking on water in Shelikof Strait 71-miles west of Kodiak June 17, 2012. \n\nThe crew was delivered safely to Kodiak and Coast Guard personnel are assessing the situation following the subsequent sinking and loss of the vessel. \n\nU.S. Coast Guard video by Air Station Kodiak.",
